{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"pressure-calculator UI copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer","detected_language":"ms","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"pressure-calculator.copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer","keys":["pressure-calculator.copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer"],"locale":"ms","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Untuk cecair statik dengan ketumpatan tetap, peningkatan tekanan pengukur adalah Δp = ρgh, di mana ketumpatan adalah dalam kg/m³, graviti dalam m/s² dan kedalaman dalam meter. Ia adalah peningkatan relatif kepada permukaan, bukan tekanan mutlak.","record_id":"2b102e3148ab77c8690876887e3f643a18513525f8afc4987340d464ac317085","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40843674935","seconds":1.1555010729999822,"source":"For a static fluid with constant density, gauge pressure increase is Δp = ρgh, where density is in kg/m³, gravity in m/s² and depth in metres. It is the increase relative to the surface, not absolute pressure.","source_commit":"e1f72394198c1a94fce448ea14cd79b496701273","source_hash":"4265a0435d9d91fe8daadf36d0a76540c8ada62631b43757c72793732049680f","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Untuk cecair statik dengan ketumpatan tetap, peningkatan tekanan pengukur adalah Δp = ρgh, di mana ketumpatan adalah dalam kg/m³, graviti dalam m/s² dan kedalaman dalam meter. Ia adalah peningkatan relatif kepada permukaan, bukan tekanan mutlak.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
